<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JCI to issue circular on Lonrho buy.</title>
<headline>JCI to issue circular on Lonrho buy.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mining house JCI Ltd said on Friday  it planned to issue a circular to shareholders relating to its planned  acquisition of a 26.8 percent interest in Lonrho plc.</p>
<p>It said the circular would be forwarded in sufficient time to allow  for a general shareholder meeting to be convened to approve the deal  before November 20 1997.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to continue exercising caution in their  sharedealings until further notice and until the transaction circular  was distributed.</p>
<p>JCI Ltd announced on July 2 it would acquire the stake in Lonrho for  approximately 2.5 billion rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
